    "text": "By Jonathan Keilholz ,\n12 hours ago The Columbus Sonic Drive-In that closed after a fire earlier this year appears to be moving closer to reopening. According to City of Columbus building permit records reviewed by 614NOW, restoration work is underway at the restaurant at 3250 Olentangy River Rd. One permit authorizes restoration of the fire-damaged drive-thru.... Read full article",
